[node name="CarvedSaint" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "A carved saint in worn stone on a plinth (tools/build/prop_abbey_church.py), 1.8 m in all, its face nearly weathered away. Faces -Z. Model shows one of three bodies by where it stands: hands together, a book held to the breast, a tau staff (set its pick to choose; the weights are set so the six in the abbey come out as two with hands together, three with a book, one with a staff). The head is its own model under Head, which Carving turns: from Dose 50 it follows the porter while he isn't looking. No collision: it stands out of the way, against a wall."
